maihd.net/v1/images/p_movies_themandalorianandgrogu_0504_0272ce6b.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","alt_text":"Image of The Mandalorian, Grogu, Zeb, the Hutts, the Razor Crest, two Imperial walkers, and several other creatures set against an orange planet. | Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu | Rated PG-13 | Only in theaters May 22 | movie poster"},"poster_image":{"base_url":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_movies_themandalorianandgrogu_0504_0272ce6b.jpeg","base_url_https":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_movies_themandalorianandgrogu_0504_0272ce6b.jpeg","api_params":{"region":"0,0,540,810"},"cdn_url":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_movies_themandalorianandgrogu_0504_0272ce6b.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","cdn_url_https":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_movies_themandalorianandgrogu_0504_0272ce6b.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","alt_text":"Image of The Mandalorian, Grogu, Zeb, the Hutts, the Razor Crest, two Imperial walkers, and several other creatures set against an orange planet. | Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu | Rated PG-13 | Only in theaters May 22 | movie poster"},"logo_image":{"base_url":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_movies_themandalorianandgrogu_0504_0272ce6b.jpeg","base_url_https":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_movies_themandalorianandgrogu_0504_0272ce6b.jpeg","api_params":{"region":"0,0,540,810"},"cdn_url":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_movies_themandalorianandgrogu_0504_0272ce6b.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","cdn_url_https":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_movies_themandalorianandgrogu_0504_0272ce6b.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","alt_text":"Image of The Mandalorian, Grogu, Zeb, the Hutts, the Razor Crest, two Imperial walkers, and several other creatures set against an orange planet. | Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu | Rated PG-13 | Only in theaters May 22 | movie poster"}}},"medium_description":"The evil Empire has fallen, and Imperial warlords r