 her cautious mother, Alice (voice of Rashida Jones), they uncover family mysteries that could change the world of witches forever. Directed by Fawn Veerasunthorn and Jason Hand, co-directed by Josie Trinidad, and produced by Roy Conli and Yvett Merino.\r\n \r\nJoining previously announced voice cast members Hailee Steinfeld and Rashida Jones are seven-time Emmy Award® winner Tracey Ullman (“The Tracey Ullman Show,” “Tracey Takes On…,” “Bullets Over Broadway,” “Robin Hood: Men in Tights”) who voices the enchanted feather quill pen Ms. Quill, and Stephen Fry (“The Interrogator,” “The Hobbit” trilogy, “Gosford Park,” “Jeeves and Wooster,” “V for Vendetta”) as the magical journal Elias Quire.","images":{"assets":{"catalog_poster_image":{"base_url":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg","base_url_https":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg","api_params":{"region":"0,0,540,810"},"cdn_url":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","cdn_url_https":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","alt_text":"Image of the animated character Billie (voiced by Hailee Steinfeld) hovering in the air with several small objects surrounding her. She has a surprised look. | From the studio that brought you Frozen and Zootopia | Disney | Hexed | Something is happening to Billie... | In theaters November 25 | movie poster"},"poster_image":{"base_url":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg","base_url_https":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg","api_params":{"region":"0,0,540,810"},"cdn_url":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","cdn_url_https":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","alt_text":"Image of the animated character Billie (voiced by Hailee Steinfeld) hovering in the air with several small objects surrounding her. She has a surprised look. | From the studio that brought you Frozen and Zootopia | Disney | Hexed | Something is happening to Billie... | In theaters November 25 | movie poster"},"logo_image":{"base_url":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg","base_url_https":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg","api_params":{"region":"0,0,540,810"},"cdn_url":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","cdn_url_https":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","alt_text":"Image of the animated character Billie (voiced by Hailee Steinfeld) hovering in the air with several small objects surrounding her. She has a surprised look. | From the studio that brought you Frozen and Zootopia | Disney | Hexed | Something is happening to Billie... | In theaters November 25 | movie poster"}}},"medium_description":"In “Hexed,” an impulsive and unconventional teenage girl named Billie (voice of Hailee Steinfeld) discovers secret magical abilities which, once unleashed, hurtle her into a spectacle-filled journey out of suburbia and into a vast witch realm called Hexe. Forced to team up with her cautious mother, Alice (voice of Rashida Jones), they uncover family mysteries that could change the world of witches forever. Directed by Fawn Veerasunthorn and Jason Hand, co-directed by Josie Trinidad, and produced by Roy Conli and Yvett Merino.\r\n \r\nJoining previously announced voice cast members Hailee Steinfeld and Rashida Jones are seven-time Emmy Award® winner Tracey Ullman (“The Tracey Ullman Show,” “Tracey Takes On…,” “Bullets Over Broadway,” “Robin Hood: Men in Tights”) who voices the enchanted feather quill pen Ms. Quill, and Stephen Fry (“The Interrogator,” “The Hobbit” trilogy, “Gosford Park,” “Jeeves and Wooster,” “V for Vendetta”) as the magical journal Elias Quire.","movie_id":"5f2b7eb58da257aa28c2cce8","page_status":"Live","page_url_id":"6a330b938b7dd1e4384fc200","portal_id":"5a49d3800680a7453d214587","production_year":2026,"rating":"Not Yet Rated","rating_system":"MPAA","released_on":"2026-11-25","short_description":"In “Hexed,” an impulsive and unconventional teenage girl named Billie (voice of Hailee Steinfeld) discovers secret magical abilities...","slug":"hexed","style_object_id":"5a4d60618b5bf3f26792b97f","title":"Hexed","id":"5f2b7eb58da257aa28c2cce8","type":"Movie","asset_catalog_poster_image":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","catalog_poster_image_fog":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","asset_logo_image":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","logo_image_fog":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","asset_poster_image":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","poster_image_fog":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","primary_image_url":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","secure_image_url":"https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/p_disneymovies_hexed_poster_v1_001b9689.jpeg?region=0%2C0%2C540%2C810","content_path":"/hexed","content_url":"https://movies.disney.com/hexed","url":"https://movies.disney.com/hexed","config_bundle_schema_data":{"oneid_version":"v4","video_player_vers